{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 91, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "citation_fragment_not_rule", "reason": "法学期刊引注残片（判例/条文引用），无「须/不得」义务，不构成可判定规则", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-128", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "Furthermore, the FTC views advertising claims from the standpoint of the intended audience.", "unit_id": "0ab467c5d15f6ab6d6e7", "unit_type": "clause"}
