{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 137, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "narrative_no_obligation", "reason": "叙述性正文：陈述事实/背景/定义，未含义务或禁止模态，落不了「命中→处理」形态", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-130", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "Extrinsic evidence such as consumer surveys and copy tests can be valuable in determining how consumers interpret certain implied claims.", "unit_id": "0e6c0961e9f1dc6376a0", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 123, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "narrative_no_obligation", "reason": "叙述性正文：陈述事实/背景/定义，未含义务或禁止模态，落不了「命中→处理」形态", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-131", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "In many cases, however, the claims conveyed are clear enough on the face of an ad, without the need for extrinsic evidence.", "unit_id": "d34549fbf7daba952b8f", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 180, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "narrative_no_obligation", "reason": "叙述性正文：陈述事实/背景/定义，未含义务或禁止模态，落不了「命中→处理」形态", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-132", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "[20]\n Example 1: A brochure for a weight-loss product shows images of doctors in white lab coats looking through microscopes, molecular structures, and a stack of medical journals.", "unit_id": "e8c2a88048138223b5bb", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 168, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "narrative_no_obligation", "reason": "叙述性正文：陈述事实/背景/定义，未含义务或禁止模态，落不了「命中→处理」形态", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-133", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "These images give an impression of scientific legitimacy and likely convey an implied claim that the product has been clinically proven to be effective for weight loss.", "unit_id": "07f84be8406fde3cd2dd", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 191, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "policy_example_not_rule", "reason": "政策举例（Example N /「The marketer …」情形描述），是示例不是规范条款，单独不成规则（其规范结论在对应正文条款）", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-134", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "Example 2: A magazine ad for a children’s nutritional drink features an image of the straw from the drink box encircling a child to create a barrier as another child sneezes in her direction.", "unit_id": "c246bb9539d6968fd35b", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 132, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "narrative_no_obligation", "reason": "叙述性正文：陈述事实/背景/定义，未含义务或禁止模态，落不了「命中→处理」形态", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-135", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "The image used in the ad likely implies that the product can help protect children from catching colds or other airborne infections.", "unit_id": "2c4d8b5e70d531a6ed4d", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 102, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "policy_example_not_rule", "reason": "政策举例（Example N /「The marketer …」情形描述），是示例不是规范条款，单独不成规则（其规范结论在对应正文条款）", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-136", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "Example 3: An ad for a vitamin supplement claims that 90% of cardiologists regularly take the product.", "unit_id": "76d341443356bc6e8dea", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 182, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "narrative_no_obligation", "reason": "叙述性正文：陈述事实/背景/定义，未含义务或禁止模态，落不了「命中→处理」形态", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-137", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "In addition to the express claim about the percentage of cardiologists who use the product, the ad likely conveys an implied claim that the product offers some benefit for the heart.", "unit_id": "bc9a3a5f1e1c80fbb60d", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 119, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "policy_example_not_rule", "reason": "政策举例（Example N /「The marketer …」情形描述），是示例不是规范条款，单独不成规则（其规范结论在对应正文条款）", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-138", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "Example 4: An ad for an infant formula states that an ingredient added to the formula can reduce the symptoms of colic.", "unit_id": "d76c59d56aabb07c1127", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 191, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "narrative_no_obligation", "reason": "叙述性正文：陈述事实/背景/定义，未含义务或禁止模态，落不了「命中→处理」形态", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-139", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "The ad includes an unrelated chart from a pediatric journal showing that, as a general principle, the length of time that colicky babies cry tends to decrease over the first 12 weeks of life.", "unit_id": "93a484e1fb19e17adcbe", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 136, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "narrative_no_obligation", "reason": "叙述性正文：陈述事实/背景/定义，未含义务或禁止模态，落不了「命中→处理」形态", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-140", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "The graph has nothing to do with the effect of the infant formula on crying; it merely shows that crying decreases as a function of age.", "unit_id": "bd19d6215ae985f39aad", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 146, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "narrative_no_obligation", "reason": "叙述性正文：陈述事实/背景/定义，未含义务或禁止模态，落不了「命中→处理」形态", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-141", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "Using the graph in an ad for the infant formula likely implies that the formula, rather than the babies’ ages, causes the decrease in crying time.", "unit_id": "b1de6c1d7f0c032a0e1e", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 267, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "narrative_no_obligation", "reason": "叙述性正文：陈述事实/背景/定义，未含义务或禁止模态，落不了「命中→处理」形态", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-142", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "Depending on how it is phrased or the context in which it is presented, a statement about a product’s effect on the normal “structure or function” of the body may also convey to consumers an implied c …[截断]", "unit_id": "bb520b8fb50d6c2f3c4d", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 159, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "policy_example_not_rule", "reason": "政策举例（Example N /「The marketer …」情形描述），是示例不是规范条款，单独不成规则（其规范结论在对应正文条款）", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-144", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "Example 5: An ad for an herbal supplement claims that the product boosts the immune system to help maintain a healthy nose and throat during the winter season.", "unit_id": "62222356fa50e803a181", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 97, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "narrative_no_obligation", "reason": "叙述性正文：陈述事实/背景/定义，未含义务或禁止模态，落不了「命中→处理」形态", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-145", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "The ad features the product name “Cold Away” and includes images of people sneezing and coughing.", "unit_id": "df283e0c24ff22c97b9b", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 220, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "narrative_no_obligation", "reason": "叙述性正文：陈述事实/背景/定义，未含义务或禁止模态，落不了「命中→处理」形态", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-146", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "The various elements of the ad – the product name, the depictions of cold sufferers, and the reference to nose and throat health during the winter season – likely convey to consumers that the product  …[截断]", "unit_id": "4ef4289c32f4c8ecfcda", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 146, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "narrative_no_obligation", "reason": "叙述性正文：陈述事实/背景/定义，未含义务或禁止模态，落不了「命中→处理」形态", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-147", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "Even without the product name and images, the reference to nose and throat health during the winter season likely conveys a cold prevention claim.", "unit_id": "9431d9207611c13a328d", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 135, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "policy_example_not_rule", "reason": "政策举例（Example N /「The marketer …」情形描述），是示例不是规范条款，单独不成规则（其规范结论在对应正文条款）", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-148", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "Example 6: An ad for a topical ointment called “Arthricure” claims that the product “maintains joint health and mobility” into old age.", "unit_id": "b477e327c6190bf1a5b0", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 57, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "narrative_no_obligation", "reason": "叙述性正文：陈述事实/背景/定义，未含义务或禁止模态，落不了「命中→处理」形态", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-149", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "A “before” picture shows an elderly woman using a walker.", "unit_id": "e2da92400289c3ffdd66", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 54, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "narrative_no_obligation", "reason": "叙述性正文：陈述事实/背景/定义，未含义务或禁止模态，落不了「命中→处理」形态", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-150", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "An “after” picture shows her dancing with her husband.", "unit_id": "851a2453fc69edd00c75", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 252, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "narrative_no_obligation", "reason": "叙述性正文：陈述事实/背景/定义，未含义务或禁止模态，落不了「命中→处理」形态", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-151", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "Even without the product name, which implies the product can cure arthritis, the before-and-after images, along with the references to joint health and mobility, likely convey a claim that the product …[截断]", "unit_id": "c05ae73733302ad87712", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 2, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "heading_only", "reason": "仅小节标题字母/序号（如「B.」），无判定内容 —— 建议 L2 侧重切，标题应与正文同单元", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-152", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "2.", "unit_id": "61a3d2c9c021638fa580", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 101, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "narrative_no_obligation", "reason": "叙述性正文：陈述事实/背景/定义，未含义务或禁止模态，落不了「命中→处理」形态", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-153", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "When to Disclose Qualifying Information\n An ad also can be deceptive because of what it fails to say.", "unit_id": "f550e108426e59ad031e", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 206, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "citation_fragment_not_rule", "reason": "法学期刊引注残片（判例/条文引用），无「须/不得」义务，不构成可判定规则", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-154", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "Under Section 15 of the FTC Act, an ad is misleading if it fails to disclose information that is material in light of the claims in the ad or with respect to how consumers would customarily use the pr …[截断]", "unit_id": "f93dab667943255fc526", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 162, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "narrative_no_obligation", "reason": "叙述性正文：陈述事实/背景/定义，未含义务或禁止模态，落不了「命中→处理」形态", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-158", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "Even absent affirmative safety representations, advertisers may need to inform consumers of significant safety concerns related to the customary use of a product.", "unit_id": "284d48617447f43ccc8c", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 170, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "narrative_no_obligation", "reason": "叙述性正文：陈述事实/背景/定义，未含义务或禁止模态，落不了「命中→处理」形态", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-159", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "[22]\n Example 7: An ad for a multi-vitamin and mineral supplement claims that the product can eliminate a specific mineral deficiency that results in feelings of fatigue.", "unit_id": "7288e4dedc64824d7de8", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 104, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "narrative_no_obligation", "reason": "叙述性正文：陈述事实/背景/定义，未含义务或禁止模态，落不了「命中→处理」形态", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-160", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "In fact, less than 2% of the general population to which the ad is targeted suffer from this deficiency.", "unit_id": "d7467eb16461173b972b", "unit_type": "clause"}
