{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 106, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "narrative_no_obligation", "reason": "叙述性正文：陈述事实/背景/定义，未含义务或禁止模态，落不了「命中→处理」形态", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-163", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "The weight loss for the treatment group was, in fact, significantly greater than for the control subjects.", "unit_id": "ee0674b23b582935bfe2", "unit_type": "clause"}
