{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 180, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "narrative_no_obligation", "reason": "叙述性正文：陈述事实/背景/定义，未含义务或禁止模态，落不了「命中→处理」形态", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-180", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "When an endorsement targets a specific audience, such as older adults or children, the effectiveness of the disclosure will be judged from the perspective of members of that group.", "unit_id": "13fb2616a0063d8984f6", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 128, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "narrative_no_obligation", "reason": "叙述性正文：陈述事实/背景/定义，未含义务或禁止模态，落不了「命中→处理」形态", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-181", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "The ultimate test of whether a disclosure is effective is the net impression that consumers take from an ad with the disclosure.", "unit_id": "44a5193b6a32b6fa31ea", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 128, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "narrative_no_obligation", "reason": "叙述性正文：陈述事实/背景/定义，未含义务或禁止模态，落不了「命中→处理」形态", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-182", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "If a significant minority of consumers take a misleading claim from an ad despite a disclosure, the disclosure isn’t sufficient.", "unit_id": "19d2194e7c867ab39d2f", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 108, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "policy_example_not_rule", "reason": "政策举例（Example N /「The marketer …」情形描述），是示例不是规范条款，单独不成规则（其规范结论在对应正文条款）", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-184", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "Example 12: A magazine ad for nasal strips claims that nightly application will reduce the sound of snoring.", "unit_id": "8d3d87a0acbdba27d005", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 237, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "narrative_no_obligation", "reason": "叙述性正文：陈述事实/背景/定义，未含义务或禁止模态，落不了「命中→处理」形态", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-185", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "The advertiser has competent and reliable scientific evidence that the strips substantially reduce the sound of snoring but not that they treat sleep apnea, a potentially life-threatening condition fo …[截断]", "unit_id": "a37fb2ae280bd6b7d512", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 120, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "narrative_no_obligation", "reason": "叙述性正文：陈述事实/背景/定义，未含义务或禁止模态，落不了「命中→处理」形态", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-186", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "The ad would be deceptive if it fails to adequately disclose that the nasal strips aren’t intended to treat sleep apnea.", "unit_id": "1dcf6e83d4133cb0a722", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 95, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "narrative_no_obligation", "reason": "叙述性正文：陈述事实/背景/定义，未含义务或禁止模态，落不了「命中→处理」形态", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-187", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "A fine print disclosure of this fact at the bottom of the ad wouldn’t be clear and conspicuous.", "unit_id": "71e686937e8508d9ec4d", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 192, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "narrative_no_obligation", "reason": "叙述性正文：陈述事实/背景/定义，未含义务或禁止模态，落不了「命中→处理」形态", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-188", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "A disclosure immediately next to the snoring claim in the same font size as the claim and in black print on a white background is much more likely to be effective at eliminating the deception.", "unit_id": "226fa5f847d7fe1c1f4a", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 105, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "narrative_no_obligation", "reason": "叙述性正文：陈述事实/背景/定义，未含义务或禁止模态，落不了「命中→处理」形态", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-190", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "This can be a particular challenge when explaining complicated scientific concepts to a general audience.", "unit_id": "3a048506067921559005", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 197, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "narrative_no_obligation", "reason": "叙述性正文：陈述事实/背景/定义，未含义务或禁止模态，落不了「命中→处理」形态", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-191", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "For example, it is very difficult to adequately qualify a claim based on limited and still-emerging science to make clear to consumers the uncertain and limited nature of the support for the claim.", "unit_id": "e84b10261d945925653a", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 38, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "fragment_too_short", "reason": "片段过短（38 字符）且无义务/禁止模态，是导航项/人名/残片，非完整条款", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-193", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "Vague qualifying terms are inadequate.", "unit_id": "6c8d5e4a922e3d5d7821", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 123, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "narrative_no_obligation", "reason": "叙述性正文：陈述事实/背景/定义，未含义务或禁止模态，落不了「命中→处理」形态", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-194", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "For example, it’s not enough to say that the product “may” have the claimed benefit or “helps” achieve the claimed benefit.", "unit_id": "2e1e2e0f63d7d968ab2d", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 290, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "narrative_no_obligation", "reason": "叙述性正文：陈述事实/背景/定义，未含义务或禁止模态，落不了「命中→处理」形态", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-195", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "Similarly, consumers are likely to interpret modifiers such as “promising,” “preliminary,” “initial,” or “pilot” as positive product attributes, rather than as substantial disclaimers about the state  …[截断]", "unit_id": "5ee508a4ac25eb51a479", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 216, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "narrative_no_obligation", "reason": "叙述性正文：陈述事实/背景/定义，未含义务或禁止模态，落不了「命中→处理」形态", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-196", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "[25] Thus, consumers may interpret an ad to mean that a product will prevent or reduce the risk of a disease, even if the ad includes language indicating that the science supporting the effect is limi …[截断]", "unit_id": "2fde5e3637fe79875ecd", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 127, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "policy_example_not_rule", "reason": "政策举例（Example N /「The marketer …」情形描述），是示例不是规范条款，单独不成规则（其规范结论在对应正文条款）", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-197", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "Example 13: A company has results from two studies suggesting that its supplement helps to maintain healthy cholesterol levels.", "unit_id": "d7327b00c50768aed340", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 140, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "narrative_no_obligation", "reason": "叙述性正文：陈述事实/背景/定义，未含义务或禁止模态，落不了「命中→处理」形态", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-198", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "There are, however, significant limitations to each of the studies and a better study is necessary to confirm whether the effect is genuine.", "unit_id": "5470640a32a63ccc7ddb", "unit_type": "clause"}
