{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 165, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "narrative_no_obligation", "reason": "叙述性正文：陈述事实/背景/定义，未含义务或禁止模态，落不了「命中→处理」形态", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-200", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "Although a clear and conspicuous disclosure might be effective to clarify an ambiguous claim that might otherwise be deceptive, it can’t directly contradict a claim.", "unit_id": "8113761cd18ad6b0b70c", "unit_type": "clause"}
