{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 160, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "narrative_no_obligation", "reason": "叙述性正文：陈述事实/背景/定义，未含义务或禁止模态，落不了「命中→处理」形态", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-210", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "Substantiating Claims\n In addition to conveying product claims clearly and accurately, marketers need to ensure that there is adequate support for their claims.", "unit_id": "8a37aa585e39d9e16d6e", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 160, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "narrative_no_obligation", "reason": "叙述性正文：陈述事实/背景/定义，未含义务或禁止模态，落不了「命中→处理」形态", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-212", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "What constitutes a reasonable basis depends greatly on what claims are made, how they are presented in the context of the entire ad, and how they are qualified.", "unit_id": "65280fc344ca4150ff19", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 95, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "citation_fragment_not_rule", "reason": "法学期刊引注残片（判例/条文引用），无「须/不得」义务，不构成可判定规则", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-213", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "The FTC’s substantiation standard is a rigorous one, particularly when claims relate to health.", "unit_id": "d17fe11ec6758b7fef7d", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 116, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "narrative_no_obligation", "reason": "叙述性正文：陈述事实/背景/定义，未含义务或禁止模态，落不了「命中→处理」形态", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-214", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "It is designed to ensure that consumers can have confidence in the accuracy of information presented in advertising.", "unit_id": "a6e680e968cb9b34270a", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 127, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "narrative_no_obligation", "reason": "叙述性正文：陈述事实/背景/定义，未含义务或禁止模态，落不了「命中→处理」形态", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-215", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "A number of factors determine the appropriate amount and type of substantiation required, including: [27]\n The type of product.", "unit_id": "6fcc65af3a60c3d7235c", "unit_type": "clause"}
