{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 18, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "fragment_too_short", "reason": "片段过短（18 字符）且无义务/禁止模态，是导航项/人名/残片，非完整条款", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-217", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "The type of claim.", "unit_id": "bce510b878c87e093fea", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 293, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "narrative_no_obligation", "reason": "叙述性正文：陈述事实/背景/定义，未含义务或禁止模态，落不了「命中→处理」形态", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-218", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "Claims that are difficult for consumers to assess on their own– for example, a health benefit claim that may be subject to a placebo effect, that relates to a naturally varying condition, or that can’ …[截断]", "unit_id": "2384fd879e0c3d0bb47e", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 105, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "narrative_no_obligation", "reason": "叙述性正文：陈述事实/背景/定义，未含义务或禁止模态，落不了「命中→处理」形态", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-219", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "The benefits of a truthful claim, and the cost or feasibility of developing substantiation for the claim.", "unit_id": "466f06d4af867512dd89", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 176, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "narrative_no_obligation", "reason": "叙述性正文：陈述事实/背景/定义，未含义务或禁止模态，落不了「命中→处理」形态", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-220", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "These factors are often weighed together to ensure that valuable product information isn’t withheld from consumers because the cost of developing substantiation is prohibitive.", "unit_id": "cc810a60a04fb322126a", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 146, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "narrative_no_obligation", "reason": "叙述性正文：陈述事实/背景/定义，未含义务或禁止模态，落不了「命中→处理」形态", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-221", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "This doesn’t mean, however, that an advertiser can make any claim it wants without substantiation simply because the cost of research is too high.", "unit_id": "975e37f38b56288c6030", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 34, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "fragment_too_short", "reason": "片段过短（34 字符）且无义务/禁止模态，是导航项/人名/残片，非完整条款", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-222", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "The consequences of a false claim.", "unit_id": "8f4e22f8b5b9c5122ef4", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 48, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "narrative_no_obligation", "reason": "叙述性正文：陈述事实/背景/定义，未含义务或禁止模态，落不了「命中→处理」形态", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-223", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "This includes both physical and economic injury.", "unit_id": "6c2dc8d64b93c8affc3c", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 186, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "narrative_no_obligation", "reason": "叙述性正文：陈述事实/背景/定义，未含义务或禁止模态，落不了「命中→处理」形态", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-224", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "For example, an unsubstantiated claim about the therapeutic benefit of a product could lead a consumer to forgo a more effective treatment or lifestyle change, to her physical detriment.", "unit_id": "1853417489dc8fc4bd2e", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 167, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "narrative_no_obligation", "reason": "叙述性正文：陈述事实/背景/定义，未含义务或禁止模态，落不了「命中→处理」形态", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-225", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "A consumer may suffer economic injury by purchasing an ineffective product or paying a premium for a product that provides no benefit over less expensive alternatives.", "unit_id": "d7c3e68e7267833458ad", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 77, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "narrative_no_obligation", "reason": "叙述性正文：陈述事实/背景/定义，未含义务或禁止模态，落不了「命中→处理」形态", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-226", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "The amount of substantiation that experts in the field believe is reasonable.", "unit_id": "8309289215d8413d7841", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 152, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "citation_fragment_not_rule", "reason": "法学期刊引注残片（判例/条文引用），无「须/不得」义务，不构成可判定规则", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-227", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "In making this determination, the FTC gives great weight to accepted norms in the relevant fields of research and consults with experts in those fields.", "unit_id": "6b2a0c45cc07670baf9c", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 194, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "citation_fragment_not_rule", "reason": "法学期刊引注残片（判例/条文引用），无「须/不得」义务，不构成可判定规则", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-228", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "For a health-related claim, the FTC will rely primarily on experts in the particular field of health at issue and may, in addition, consult experts on a particular ingredient or type of product.", "unit_id": "b21ce096b7d1ea2c4332", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 141, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "narrative_no_obligation", "reason": "叙述性正文：陈述事实/背景/定义，未含义务或禁止模态，落不了「命中→处理」形态", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-229", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "Thus, for example, research supporting a claim about heart benefits would need to meet accepted norms of research in the field of cardiology.", "unit_id": "6df95fef0847ea2894f1", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 261, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "citation_fragment_not_rule", "reason": "法学期刊引注残片（判例/条文引用），无「须/不得」义务，不构成可判定规则", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-230", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "Where there is an existing standard for substantiation developed by a government agency such as the FDA or the National Institutes of Health, or another authoritative body such as the National Academy …[截断]", "unit_id": "78fe2f644dfd8e23d076", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 195, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "narrative_no_obligation", "reason": "叙述性正文：陈述事实/背景/定义，未含义务或禁止模态，落不了「命中→处理」形态", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-232", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "As a general matter, substantiation of health-related benefits will need to be in the form of randomized, controlled human clinical testing to meet the competent and reliable scientific standard.", "unit_id": "61f530d51fa5d5786134", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 264, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "citation_fragment_not_rule", "reason": "法学期刊引注残片（判例/条文引用），无「须/不得」义务，不构成可判定规则", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-233", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "[31] In evaluating the reliability of such testing, the FTC will consider several parameters, such as sample size, duration, and outcome measures, that will vary depending on the exact nature of the h …[截断]", "unit_id": "eaf4d54add2294ce86b8", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 202, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "obligation_without_action", "reason": "有义务模态但既无处理动作也无阈值/词表，无法给出「命中→怎么处理」", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-234", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "Assessing whether a study is well-designed and well-conducted, and whether the data has been properly analyzed and interpreted, are tasks that should be undertaken by someone with appropriate expertis …[截断]", "unit_id": "14325ea60f5f010c4e1f", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 116, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "narrative_no_obligation", "reason": "叙述性正文：陈述事实/背景/定义，未含义务或禁止模态，落不了「命中→处理」形态", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-235", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "Marketers of health products are encouraged to consult with an independent expert in the relevant field of research.", "unit_id": "d6d4e986d26e11c9209c", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 201, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "narrative_no_obligation", "reason": "叙述性正文：陈述事实/背景/定义，未含义务或禁止模态，落不了「命中→处理」形态", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-236", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "Independent experts can provide unbiased assessments of the validity of studies, how they fit within the relevant scientific literature, and what conclusions can be legitimately drawn from the results …[截断]", "unit_id": "6c05e44f56ff3b7e5965", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 2, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "heading_only", "reason": "仅小节标题字母/序号（如「B.」），无判定内容 —— 建议 L2 侧重切，标题应与正文同单元", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-237", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "1.", "unit_id": "5f722830bfa7859913b2", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 169, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "obligation_without_action", "reason": "有义务模态但既无处理动作也无阈值/词表，无法给出「命中→怎么处理」", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-238", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "Ads that Refer to a Specific Level of Support\n As a starting point, marketers of health-related products must have at least the level of support that they claim to have.", "unit_id": "8ced918a7ee15b234e80", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 124, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "narrative_no_obligation", "reason": "叙述性正文：陈述事实/背景/定义，未含义务或禁止模态，落不了「命中→处理」形态", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-240", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "[32]\n Example 16: An ad for a supplement includes the statement “Scientists Now Agree!” in discussing the product’s benefit.", "unit_id": "7f037349b20a6f9fdb61", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 138, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "narrative_no_obligation", "reason": "叙述性正文：陈述事实/背景/定义，未含义务或禁止模态，落不了「命中→处理」形态", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-241", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "This statement likely conveys to consumers that the state of science supporting the benefit has reached the level of scientific consensus.", "unit_id": "f566fa95364f1996f672", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 119, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "narrative_no_obligation", "reason": "叙述性正文：陈述事实/背景/定义，未含义务或禁止模态，落不了「命中→处理」形态", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-242", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "Unless the advertiser possesses evidence demonstrating that scientists have reached that consensus, the claim is false.", "unit_id": "78de8ee14ab2396e3df8", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 321, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "policy_example_not_rule", "reason": "政策举例（Example N /「The marketer …」情形描述），是示例不是规范条款，单独不成规则（其规范结论在对应正文条款）", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-243", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "Example 17: An advertiser claims that its product is based on “Nobel Prize-Winning” research and has been “proven effective” by “$5 Million in NIH Research.” The Nobel Prize referred to in the ad, how …[截断]", "unit_id": "92b156d710e2e0daca2a", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 98, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "narrative_no_obligation", "reason": "叙述性正文：陈述事实/背景/定义，未含义务或禁止模态，落不了「命中→处理」形态", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-244", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "In addition, the NIH research examined the safety, but not the efficacy, of the active ingredient.", "unit_id": "16996a084bafc7ec3c53", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 178, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "citation_fragment_not_rule", "reason": "法学期刊引注残片（判例/条文引用），无「须/不得」义务，不构成可判定规则", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-245", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "The specific claims about the level of support are deceptive even if the advertiser possesses other research that provides competent and reliable scientific evidence of efficacy.", "unit_id": "baa386792e4539efbdd2", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 132, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "policy_example_not_rule", "reason": "政策举例（Example N /「The marketer …」情形描述），是示例不是规范条款，单独不成规则（其规范结论在对应正文条款）", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-246", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "Example 18: The website for a sports drink touts a “clinically tested ingredient” for improving blood flow and increasing endurance.", "unit_id": "3feec71f21723732f7f1", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 184, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "narrative_no_obligation", "reason": "叙述性正文：陈述事实/背景/定义，未含义务或禁止模态，落不了「命中→处理」形态", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-247", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "In this context, the phrase “clinically tested ingredient” implies not just that the ingredient was tested, but also that the test results prove a benefit for blood flow and endurance.", "unit_id": "66579f50ec72a70595a4", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 82, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "narrative_no_obligation", "reason": "叙述性正文：陈述事实/背景/定义，未含义务或禁止模态，落不了「命中→处理」形态", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-248", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "The phrase also conveys a claim that the sports drink will provide those benefits.", "unit_id": "b6d8f6a6d7e3542076a2", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 2, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "heading_only", "reason": "仅小节标题字母/序号（如「B.」），无判定内容 —— 建议 L2 侧重切，标题应与正文同单元", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-250", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "2.", "unit_id": "82f7440816e2d79414d2", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 168, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "narrative_no_obligation", "reason": "叙述性正文：陈述事实/背景/定义，未含义务或禁止模态，落不了「命中→处理」形态", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-252", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "[33] Although there is no requirement for a specific number of RCTs, the replication of research in an independently-conducted study adds to the weight of the evidence.", "unit_id": "794f7cc63fae6e9537b2", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 248, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "narrative_no_obligation", "reason": "叙述性正文：陈述事实/背景/定义，未含义务或禁止模态，落不了「命中→处理」形态", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-253", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "Replication in a second study by independent researchers reduces the chance that the results of a single RCT may be influenced by unanticipated, undetected, systematic biases that may occur despite th …[截断]", "unit_id": "bde1a898fcddcceb778b", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 141, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "narrative_no_obligation", "reason": "叙述性正文：陈述事实/背景/定义，未含义务或禁止模态，落不了「命中→处理」形态", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-254", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "An additional, independently conducted study to corroborate findings provides much greater confidence in the validity of the initial results.", "unit_id": "f9bf193fc98dd3c91e59", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 107, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "narrative_no_obligation", "reason": "叙述性正文：陈述事实/背景/定义，未含义务或禁止模态，落不了「命中→处理」形态", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-255", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "As discussed in the next section, however, the quality of the research is more important than the quantity.", "unit_id": "c822280bd51c70fdf87f", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 160, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "narrative_no_obligation", "reason": "叙述性正文：陈述事实/背景/定义，未含义务或禁止模态，落不了「命中→处理」形态", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-256", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "For that reason, numerous flawed and inadequate studies are unlikely to add up to competent and reliable scientific evidence sufficient to substantiate a claim.", "unit_id": "5f52ef5158a63a11cdd3", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 154, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "narrative_no_obligation", "reason": "叙述性正文：陈述事实/背景/定义，未含义务或禁止模态，落不了「命中→处理」形态", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-257", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "[34]\n Epidemiological or observational studies can be valuable to show an association between a product or ingredient, but they don’t prove a causal link.", "unit_id": "1add018f46e04efd0286", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 164, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "obligation_without_action", "reason": "有义务模态但既无处理动作也无阈值/词表，无法给出「命中→怎么处理」", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-258", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "[35] Methodologically sound human clinical testing is necessary to prove causation, although there may be limited situations where such testing may not be feasible.", "unit_id": "1718269139dc12aa489b", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 187, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "narrative_no_obligation", "reason": "叙述性正文：陈述事实/背景/定义，未含义务或禁止模态，落不了「命中→处理」形态", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-259", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "In the field of nutrition, for example, it may take decades to determine whether there is a relationship between eating a particular food or nutrient and the risk of developing a disease.", "unit_id": "c27a5f6c9ceb43a6c956", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 227, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "citation_fragment_not_rule", "reason": "法学期刊引注残片（判例/条文引用），无「须/不得」义务，不构成可判定规则", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-260", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "The FTC will accept high-quality epidemiologic evidence to substantiate a claim in those limited cases where: 1) it is considered an acceptable substitute for RCTs by experts in the field; and 2) RCTs …[截断]", "unit_id": "5c17e7f7ad9c9468af9d", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 187, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "narrative_no_obligation", "reason": "叙述性正文：陈述事实/背景/定义，未含义务或禁止模态，落不了「命中→处理」形态", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-261", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "Animal and in vitro studies may provide useful supporting or background information, but, without confirmation by human RCTs, they aren’t sufficient to substantiate health-related claims.", "unit_id": "d18c5bed7e806f640fb6", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 178, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "narrative_no_obligation", "reason": "叙述性正文：陈述事实/背景/定义，未含义务或禁止模态，落不了「命中→处理」形态", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-262", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "[36] Animal studies have only limited value in predicting the effect of a product in humans, making it difficult to extrapolate results in animal research to benefits for humans.", "unit_id": "eaa474b66c718e7e9a64", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 193, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "narrative_no_obligation", "reason": "叙述性正文：陈述事实/背景/定义，未含义务或禁止模态，落不了「命中→处理」形态", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-263", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "In vitro studies look at a product’s effect on isolated cells or tissues and may help identify a possible mechanism of action, but similarly are of limited value to predict benefits for humans.", "unit_id": "4d884af598a629fdcdc7", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 191, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "narrative_no_obligation", "reason": "叙述性正文：陈述事实/背景/定义，未含义务或禁止模态，落不了「命中→处理」形态", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-264", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "Anecdotal evidence about the individual experiences of consumers, including surveys of consumer experiences, are never sufficient to substantiate claims about the effects of a health product.", "unit_id": "aaea40369550942f4640", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 134, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "narrative_no_obligation", "reason": "叙述性正文：陈述事实/背景/定义，未含义务或禁止模态，落不了「命中→处理」形态", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-265", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "[37] Even if consumer experiences are genuine, they may be attributable to a placebo effect or other factors unrelated to the product.", "unit_id": "f73e5d8ae513bbf0accd", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 177, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "narrative_no_obligation", "reason": "叙述性正文：陈述事实/背景/定义，未含义务或禁止模态，落不了「命中→处理」形态", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-266", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "For the same reason, a healthcare practitioner’s observation about the effect of a health product on patients is anecdotal and doesn’t provide evidence of a causal relationship.", "unit_id": "8fd0b4a29eefe64d8db5", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 67, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "narrative_no_obligation", "reason": "叙述性正文：陈述事实/背景/定义，未含义务或禁止模态，落不了「命中→处理」形态", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-267", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "Individual experiences aren’t a substitute for scientific research.", "unit_id": "3c29d5f907eef899746e", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 136, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "narrative_no_obligation", "reason": "叙述性正文：陈述事实/背景/定义，未含义务或禁止模态，落不了「命中→处理」形态", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-268", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "Finally, advertisers shouldn’t rely on public health recommendations, such as advisories from a medical organization, as substantiation.", "unit_id": "ec80d6dc253eb1795709", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 111, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "narrative_no_obligation", "reason": "叙述性正文：陈述事实/背景/定义，未含义务或禁止模态，落不了「命中→处理」形态", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-269", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "Public health recommendations and advisories reflect a judgment based on the best currently available evidence.", "unit_id": "ff7b632bc6b7f3dde540", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 128, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "narrative_no_obligation", "reason": "叙述性正文：陈述事实/背景/定义，未含义务或禁止模态，落不了「命中→处理」形态", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-270", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "They aren’t equivalent to a finding that there is a causal link between the recommended course of action and the health benefit.", "unit_id": "8c114e3b8ea7e0208eff", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 95, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "narrative_no_obligation", "reason": "叙述性正文：陈述事实/背景/定义，未含义务或禁止模态，落不了「命中→处理」形态", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-271", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "[38] For that reason, public health recommendations alone aren’t sufficient to support a claim.", "unit_id": "5e76be2b08049108f6a5", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 188, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "policy_example_not_rule", "reason": "政策举例（Example N /「The marketer …」情形描述），是示例不是规范条款，单独不成规则（其规范结论在对应正文条款）", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-273", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "Example 19: An advertiser relies on animal and in vitro studies to support a claim that its vitamin supplement is more easily absorbed into the bloodstream than other forms of the vitamin.", "unit_id": "e40d4bbb6a7fec541a52", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 238, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "narrative_no_obligation", "reason": "叙述性正文：陈述事实/背景/定义，未含义务或禁止模态，落不了「命中→处理」形态", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-274", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "However, the animal research uses a species of animal that, unlike humans, is able to synthesize the vitamin, and the in vitro study uses a different formulation with a higher concentration of the com …[截断]", "unit_id": "f50750ba0817411fdaf6", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 162, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "narrative_no_obligation", "reason": "叙述性正文：陈述事实/背景/定义，未含义务或禁止模态，落不了「命中→处理」形态", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-275", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "In addition, in this instance, human research is feasible and is the type of research generally considered necessary by experts to demonstrate vitamin absorption.", "unit_id": "ff4945fa43f561133cf6", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 170, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "narrative_no_obligation", "reason": "叙述性正文：陈述事实/背景/定义，未含义务或禁止模态，落不了「命中→处理」形态", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-276", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "The substantiation is inadequate because there are significant methodological problems and because human research is both feasible and the accepted approach in the field.", "unit_id": "9bfe213e0733e118e928", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 99, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "policy_example_not_rule", "reason": "政策举例（Example N /「The marketer …」情形描述），是示例不是规范条款，单独不成规则（其规范结论在对应正文条款）", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-277", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "Example 20: A company advertises its supplement as helpful in maintaining good vision into old age.", "unit_id": "598a740da9c8dc5fe427", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 185, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "narrative_no_obligation", "reason": "叙述性正文：陈述事实/背景/定义，未含义务或禁止模态，落不了「命中→处理」形态", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-278", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "There have been two large-scale epidemiologic studies showing a strong association between long-term consumption of the ingredient in the supplement and better vision in people over 70.", "unit_id": "b57fb548dea2e5237d03", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 94, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "narrative_no_obligation", "reason": "叙述性正文：陈述事实/背景/定义，未含义务或禁止模态，落不了「命中→处理」形态", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-279", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "Experts also have identified a plausible biological mechanism that likely explains the effect.", "unit_id": "82d901ae77b0672ac888", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 113, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "narrative_no_obligation", "reason": "叙述性正文：陈述事实/背景/定义，未含义务或禁止模态，落不了「命中→处理」形态", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-280", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "A clinical intervention trial would be very difficult and costly to conduct and would take a minimum of 10 years.", "unit_id": "d9736ce65cc805d39195", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 224, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "narrative_no_obligation", "reason": "叙述性正文：陈述事实/背景/定义，未含义务或禁止模态，落不了「命中→处理」形态", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-281", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "Assuming that experts in the field generally consider epidemiological evidence to be adequate to support the potential for a protective effect, and assuming the absence of contrary evidence, the claim …[截断]", "unit_id": "d0ed329e5975ad9240a5", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 144, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "narrative_no_obligation", "reason": "叙述性正文：陈述事实/背景/定义，未含义务或禁止模态，落不了「命中→处理」形态", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-282", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "Because the evidence is based on long-term consumption, the claim shouldn’t suggest to consumers that they can expect immediate vision benefits.", "unit_id": "130b4b6106b96dd8edfe", "unit_type": "clause"}
