{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 215, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "narrative_no_obligation", "reason": "叙述性正文：陈述事实/背景/定义，未含义务或禁止模态，落不了「命中→处理」形态", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-284", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "The survey results are accurately described, but because the survey provides nothing more than a collection of anecdotal experiences, it isn’t adequate to substantiate that the supplement has any bene …[截断]", "unit_id": "341db25ef7162c5b9a3b", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 186, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "narrative_no_obligation", "reason": "叙述性正文：陈述事实/背景/定义，未含义务或禁止模态，落不了「命中→处理」形态", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-286", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "The recommendation is accurately reported, but it doesn’t provide substantiation for any express or implied claim that the marketer’s brain training program will provide memory benefits.", "unit_id": "b6cec71978e62ccb65ad", "unit_type": "clause"}
