{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 238, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "narrative_no_obligation", "reason": "叙述性正文：陈述事实/背景/定义，未含义务或禁止模态，落不了「命中→处理」形态", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-292", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "Because, as a general matter, health benefit claims will require evidence in the form of human clinical testing to substantiate that the product provides the claimed benefit, this section focuses on a …[截断]", "unit_id": "166a5a36d687d2993eb4", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 115, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "narrative_no_obligation", "reason": "叙述性正文：陈述事实/背景/定义，未含义务或禁止模态，落不了「命中→处理」形态", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-293", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "The scientific community has generally accepted several basic principles as enhancing the validity of test results.", "unit_id": "5e7b3e7ab82507103015", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 99, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "obligation_without_action", "reason": "有义务模态但既无处理动作也无阈值/词表，无法给出「命中→怎么处理」", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-295", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "[39]\n Control Group: Human clinical studies should have both a treatment group and a control group.", "unit_id": "a37bf7d76b6c96b3765e", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 133, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "obligation_without_action", "reason": "有义务模态但既无处理动作也无阈值/词表，无法给出「命中→怎么处理」", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-296", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "The efficacy of a product should be demonstrated by comparing the results of the treatment group to the results of the control group.", "unit_id": "a3c5f122340599a3b437", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 302, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "narrative_no_obligation", "reason": "叙述性正文：陈述事实/背景/定义，未含义务或禁止模态，落不了「命中→处理」形态", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-297", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "Improvements over time in the treatment group alone could result from a placebo effect, spontaneous changes in subjects’ health, improvements in performance on a test measure purely as the result of p …[截断]", "unit_id": "d8a5e142746dca2c1f25", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 175, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "narrative_no_obligation", "reason": "叙述性正文：陈述事实/背景/定义，未含义务或禁止模态，落不了「命中→处理」形态", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-298", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "An appropriately designed control (ideally a control using a placebo or sham treatment) helps to isolate the effects of these other variables from the effect of the treatment.", "unit_id": "db8f4380db9b2aceed48", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 67, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "obligation_without_action", "reason": "有义务模态但既无处理动作也无阈值/词表，无法给出「命中→怎么处理」", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-300", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "A cross-over design may not be appropriate to test some hypotheses.", "unit_id": "d2b9a091d81de0e60d5b", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 170, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "narrative_no_obligation", "reason": "叙述性正文：陈述事实/背景/定义，未含义务或禁止模态，落不了「命中→处理」形态", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-302", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "Substantial differences between the control and treatment groups in age, gender, diet, health status, or other characteristics can undermine the validity of any findings.", "unit_id": "c3134e15ef5fc7d41cd4", "unit_type": "clause"}
