{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 127, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "narrative_no_obligation", "reason": "叙述性正文：陈述事实/背景/定义，未含义务或禁止模态，落不了「命中→处理」形态", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-342", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "The advertiser relies on these summaries to support a claim that its supplement, which contains the same nutrient, aids memory.", "unit_id": "c175af1fd3a9c9700d3f", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 204, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "narrative_no_obligation", "reason": "叙述性正文：陈述事实/背景/定义，未含义务或禁止模态，落不了「命中→处理」形态", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-343", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "However, without looking carefully at the specifics of the study design, implementation, and results, there is no way for the advertiser to ascertain whether the research substantiates the product cla …[截断]", "unit_id": "ec06a8fabc2ee3792598", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 78, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "narrative_no_obligation", "reason": "叙述性正文：陈述事实/背景/定义，未含义务或禁止模态，落不了「命中→处理」形态", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-344", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "(For example, did the research use a comparable formulation of the ingredient?", "unit_id": "b958dfd1d51231205c48", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 36, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "fragment_too_short", "reason": "片段过短（36 字符）且无义务/禁止模态，是导航项/人名/残片，非完整条款", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-345", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "Was the study adequately controlled?", "unit_id": "34bca54a99b9330c21ee", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 146, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "policy_example_not_rule", "reason": "政策举例（Example N /「The marketer …」情形描述），是示例不是规范条款，单独不成规则（其规范结论在对应正文条款）", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-347", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "Example 24: An advertiser makes an unqualified claim about the anti-clotting effect of a supplement that contains a compound extracted from fruit.", "unit_id": "9f787d3cafb5086aa2fe", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 84, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "narrative_no_obligation", "reason": "叙述性正文：陈述事实/背景/定义，未含义务或禁止模态，落不了「命中→处理」形态", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-348", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "There are two human clinical studies supporting the effect and no contrary evidence.", "unit_id": "62ce464af7fb20b0df4d", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 84, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "narrative_no_obligation", "reason": "叙述性正文：陈述事实/背景/定义，未含义务或禁止模态，落不了「命中→处理」形态", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-349", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "One study consists of subjects tested over a one-week period, with no control group.", "unit_id": "7ae14f65ad9572091fed", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 128, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "narrative_no_obligation", "reason": "叙述性正文：陈述事实/背景/定义，未含义务或禁止模态，落不了「命中→处理」形态", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-350", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "The second study is well-controlled and of longer duration, but shows only a slight effect that isn’t statistically significant.", "unit_id": "94b1b26e55c72bd3f1c8", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 112, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "narrative_no_obligation", "reason": "叙述性正文：陈述事实/背景/定义，未含义务或禁止模态，落不了「命中→处理」形态", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-351", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "Because both studies have significant limitations, they don’t substantiate a claim about anti-clotting benefits.", "unit_id": "f47f625ee9b7d821ddb4", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 141, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "policy_example_not_rule", "reason": "政策举例（Example N /「The marketer …」情形描述），是示例不是规范条款，单独不成规则（其规范结论在对应正文条款）", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-352", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "Example 25: The marketer of an herbal supplement claims that its product promotes healthy vision and is approved in Germany for this purpose.", "unit_id": "b08794ab09bd569b6a14", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 187, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "narrative_no_obligation", "reason": "叙述性正文：陈述事实/背景/定义，未含义务或禁止模态，落不了「命中→处理」形态", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-353", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "The product has been used extensively in Europe for years and has obtained approval from the German regulators through their monograph process for use to improve vision in healthy people.", "unit_id": "10a5d9fbcc7b6854bf71", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 223, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "narrative_no_obligation", "reason": "叙述性正文：陈述事实/背景/定义，未含义务或禁止模态，落不了「命中→处理」形态", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-354", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "The company has two abstracts of German trials that were the basis of the monograph, showing that the herbal supplement significantly improved the vision of healthy individuals in the treatment group  …[截断]", "unit_id": "d2701c6acd090ca29c83", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 121, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "narrative_no_obligation", "reason": "叙述性正文：陈述事实/背景/定义，未含义务或禁止模态，落不了「命中→处理」形态", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-355", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "Approval of the supplement under the German monograph doesn’t constitute substantiation that the supplement is effective.", "unit_id": "b41f4988fa203072d8ae", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 166, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "policy_example_not_rule", "reason": "政策举例（Example N /「The marketer …」情形描述），是示例不是规范条款，单独不成规则（其规范结论在对应正文条款）", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-358", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "Example 26: The marketer of a liquid protein and vitamin shake commissioned a study to evaluate whether the shake is effective in treating symptoms of osteoarthritis.", "unit_id": "bc62b6f2a911bac59a12", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 75, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "narrative_no_obligation", "reason": "叙述性正文：陈述事实/背景/定义，未含义务或禁止模态，落不了「命中→处理」形态", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-359", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "The 200 subjects had all been diagnosed with mild to severe osteoarthritis.", "unit_id": "60ade399ae584fbbf179", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 178, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "narrative_no_obligation", "reason": "叙述性正文：陈述事实/背景/定义，未含义务或禁止模态，落不了「命中→处理」形态", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-360", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "The study was randomized, placebo-controlled, double-blind, and used a validated measure of osteoarthritis symptoms, assessing subjects at regular intervals over a 90-day period.", "unit_id": "6fb063b07cb125987976", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 139, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "narrative_no_obligation", "reason": "叙述性正文：陈述事实/背景/定义，未含义务或禁止模态，落不了「命中→处理」形态", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-361", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "The study author reported that subjects using the shake showed a statistically significant improvement in symptoms from baseline to day 90.", "unit_id": "464c769c8f6bea2d80b2", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 211, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "narrative_no_obligation", "reason": "叙述性正文：陈述事实/背景/定义，未含义务或禁止模态，落不了「命中→处理」形态", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-362", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "This result, however, doesn’t substantiate a marketing claim that the shake can treat symptoms of osteoarthritis because it doesn’t compare improvement in the treatment group to improvement in the con …[截断]", "unit_id": "141c29eb01eeac4a4c93", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 163, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "narrative_no_obligation", "reason": "叙述性正文：陈述事实/背景/定义，未含义务或禁止模态，落不了「命中→处理」形态", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-363", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "In fact, both groups saw some improvement on the measure over time and the treatment group improvement wasn’t statistically greater than that of the control group.", "unit_id": "c094db78c70fa88d0c81", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 157, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "narrative_no_obligation", "reason": "叙述性正文：陈述事实/背景/定义，未含义务或禁止模态，落不了「命中→处理」形态", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-364", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "The marketer then searches the data from the study for statistically significant outcomes, looking at comparisons that weren’t part of the original protocol.", "unit_id": "3c9f8d95b3b4ca394244", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 237, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "narrative_no_obligation", "reason": "叙述性正文：陈述事实/背景/定义，未含义务或禁止模态，落不了「命中→处理」形态", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-365", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "This post hoc analysis of the findings shows that, for a small subgroup of subjects diagnosed with the mildest osteoarthritis, there is a statistically greater improvement in symptoms in the treatment …[截断]", "unit_id": "c888136f9b3ab80d14bf", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 119, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "narrative_no_obligation", "reason": "叙述性正文：陈述事实/背景/定义，未含义务或禁止模态，落不了「命中→处理」形态", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-366", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "The post hoc analysis of the data doesn’t provide reliable evidence of a benefit for subjects with mild osteoarthritis.", "unit_id": "8a20f3cb39063fa1b0e9", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 175, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "policy_example_not_rule", "reason": "政策举例（Example N /「The marketer …」情形描述），是示例不是规范条款，单独不成规则（其规范结论在对应正文条款）", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-368", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "Example 27: The marketer of an at-home brain stimulation device conducts a randomized, controlled, double-blind study of the effects of its device on subjects with depression.", "unit_id": "3a90d01b8950483ce705", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 101, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "narrative_no_obligation", "reason": "叙述性正文：陈述事实/背景/定义，未含义务或禁止模态，落不了「命中→处理」形态", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-369", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "The study uses eight validated measures to assess the impact of the device on symptoms of depression.", "unit_id": "9da720ba240b0ae4beb7", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 130, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "narrative_no_obligation", "reason": "叙述性正文：陈述事实/背景/定义，未含义务或禁止模态，落不了「命中→处理」形态", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-370", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "Subjects show statistically greater improvement in the treatment group compared to the control group on one of the eight measures.", "unit_id": "597943fc6e5e38e3abd9", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 82, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "narrative_no_obligation", "reason": "叙述性正文：陈述事实/背景/定义，未含义务或禁止模态，落不了「命中→处理」形态", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-371", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "The other seven measures reveal no difference between treatment and control group.", "unit_id": "9e6f4665365eace34e5e", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 83, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "narrative_no_obligation", "reason": "叙述性正文：陈述事实/背景/定义，未含义务或禁止模态，落不了「命中→处理」形态", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-372", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "The study doesn’t include any statistical correction for the use of multiple tests.", "unit_id": "a252bd9fdb575926d511", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 117, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "narrative_no_obligation", "reason": "叙述性正文：陈述事实/背景/定义，未含义务或禁止模态，落不了「命中→处理」形态", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-373", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "The fact that only one outcome out of a total of eight showed statistical significance could be the result of chance.", "unit_id": "bc98444986c36802ea0e", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 92, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "narrative_no_obligation", "reason": "叙述性正文：陈述事实/背景/定义，未含义务或禁止模态，落不了「命中→处理」形态", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-374", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "The higher the number of outcomes tested, the greater the chance of a false positive result.", "unit_id": "cc949df17b22b175bcf1", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 125, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "narrative_no_obligation", "reason": "叙述性正文：陈述事实/背景/定义，未含义务或禁止模态，落不了「命中→处理」形态", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-375", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "The marketer can’t rely on this one positive finding from the study to substantiate a claim about any benefit for depression.", "unit_id": "ba361e90f864974ba569", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 77, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "policy_example_not_rule", "reason": "政策举例（Example N /「The marketer …」情形描述），是示例不是规范条款，单独不成规则（其规范结论在对应正文条款）", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-376", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "Example 28: A dietary supplement is advertised to treat erectile dysfunction.", "unit_id": "0473b9fe2022404f0e61", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 137, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "narrative_no_obligation", "reason": "叙述性正文：陈述事实/背景/定义，未含义务或禁止模态，落不了「命中→处理」形态", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-377", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "The advertiser relies on a human clinical study that uses both a validated objective measure and an unvalidated subjective questionnaire.", "unit_id": "1433ec200b33e7742ef1", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 178, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "narrative_no_obligation", "reason": "叙述性正文：陈述事实/背景/定义，未含义务或禁止模态，落不了「命中→处理」形态", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-378", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "The study detects a small statistically significant difference using the unvalidated questionnaire, but there is no statistically significant difference on the validated measure.", "unit_id": "643e6c0ceb97dd9eab29", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 184, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "narrative_no_obligation", "reason": "叙述性正文：陈述事实/背景/定义，未含义务或禁止模态，落不了「命中→处理」形态", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-379", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "The failure to detect a difference using the more reliable validated measure suggests that there wasn’t a significant effect from use of the product, and the claim isn’t substantiated.", "unit_id": "9bcf8b48a710517af736", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 2, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "heading_only", "reason": "仅小节标题字母/序号（如「B.」），无判定内容 —— 建议 L2 侧重切，标题应与正文同单元", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-380", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "4.", "unit_id": "1f5ec7d1b9674ae3ac0c", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 71, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "narrative_no_obligation", "reason": "叙述性正文：陈述事实/背景/定义，未含义务或禁止模态，落不了「命中→处理」形态", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-381", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "The Totality of the Evidence\n Studies can’t be considered in isolation.", "unit_id": "b9b42970a07b6a30218a", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 119, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "narrative_no_obligation", "reason": "叙述性正文：陈述事实/背景/定义，未含义务或禁止模态，落不了「命中→处理」形态", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-382", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "The surrounding context of the scientific evidence is just as important as the internal validity of individual studies.", "unit_id": "17106b00bad9865addd9", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 102, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "obligation_without_action", "reason": "有义务模态但既无处理动作也无阈值/词表，无法给出「命中→怎么处理」", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-384", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "Studies relied on by an advertiser should be largely consistent with the surrounding body of evidence.", "unit_id": "41fab6d454b00f22e9e1", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 161, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "narrative_no_obligation", "reason": "叙述性正文：陈述事实/背景/定义，未含义务或禁止模态，落不了「命中→处理」形态", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-385", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "[42] Wide variations in outcomes of studies and inconsistent or conflicting results raise serious questions about the adequacy of an advertiser’s substantiation.", "unit_id": "a04341296829d06a95cb", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 139, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "narrative_no_obligation", "reason": "叙述性正文：陈述事实/背景/定义，未含义务或禁止模态，落不了「命中→处理」形态", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-386", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "Where there are inconsistencies in the evidence, it is important to examine whether there is a sound explanation for those inconsistencies.", "unit_id": "ceff01ac823c1da815c9", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 135, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "narrative_no_obligation", "reason": "叙述性正文：陈述事实/背景/定义，未含义务或禁止模态，落不了「命中→处理」形态", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-387", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "In some instances, for example, the differences in results are attributable to differences in dosage, the form of administration ( e.g.", "unit_id": "e9b28521e84096177801", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 85, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "narrative_no_obligation", "reason": "叙述性正文：陈述事实/背景/定义，未含义务或禁止模态，落不了「命中→处理」形态", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-388", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": ", oral or intravenous), the population tested, or other aspects of study methodology.", "unit_id": "11521ff8033e33965b3a", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 170, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "narrative_no_obligation", "reason": "叙述性正文：陈述事实/背景/定义，未含义务或禁止模态，落不了「命中→处理」形态", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-392", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "The totality of the evidence also will affect how a claim is presented – that is, how carefully the claim is qualified to reflect accurately the strength of the evidence.", "unit_id": "58e549dac0ff3adb6864", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 127, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "narrative_no_obligation", "reason": "叙述性正文：陈述事实/背景/定义，未含义务或禁止模态，落不了「命中→处理」形态", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-393", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "If a stronger body of surrounding evidence runs contrary to a claimed effect, even a qualified claim is likely to be deceptive.", "unit_id": "8b802b34320c14e3f9cd", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 134, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "narrative_no_obligation", "reason": "叙述性正文：陈述事实/背景/定义，未含义务或禁止模态，落不了「命中→处理」形态", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-394", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "[43]\n Example 29: The marketer of a juice high in antioxidants claims that daily consumption of the juice treats erectile dysfunction.", "unit_id": "94abab0014911f9a82ff", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 283, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "narrative_no_obligation", "reason": "叙述性正文：陈述事实/背景/定义，未含义务或禁止模态，落不了「命中→处理」形态", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-395", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "The marketer relies on a published 50-person controlled human clinical trial as support for its claim, while disregarding an earlier, higher quality unpublished 100-person study of the juice that fail …[截断]", "unit_id": "20f84c99f81aad531eb6", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 140, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "narrative_no_obligation", "reason": "叙述性正文：陈述事实/背景/定义，未含义务或禁止模态，落不了「命中→处理」形态", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-396", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "The marketer commissioned both studies and changed the measured endpoint in the second study after reviewing the results of the first study.", "unit_id": "c0f44b68b4f1998bf128", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 64, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "narrative_no_obligation", "reason": "叙述性正文：陈述事实/背景/定义，未含义务或禁止模态，落不了「命中→处理」形态", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-398", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "The erectile dysfunction treatment claims are not substantiated.", "unit_id": "1cd8abdb5a7adf1353db", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 94, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "policy_example_not_rule", "reason": "政策举例（Example N /「The marketer …」情形描述），是示例不是规范条款，单独不成规则（其规范结论在对应正文条款）", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-399", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "Example 30: An advertiser wants to claim that a supplement will substantially reduce body fat.", "unit_id": "ac68f49522cf4e4f7129", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 147, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "narrative_no_obligation", "reason": "叙述性正文：陈述事实/背景/定义，未含义务或禁止模态，落不了「命中→处理」形态", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-400", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "The advertiser has two controlled, double-blind studies showing a modest but statistically significant loss of fat at the end of a six-week period.", "unit_id": "ebf0774aa0d0805dbf6c", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 158, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "narrative_no_obligation", "reason": "叙述性正文：陈述事实/背景/定义，未含义务或禁止模态，落不了「命中→处理」形态", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-401", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "However, there is an equally well-controlled, double-blind 12-week study showing no statistically significant difference between treatment and control groups.", "unit_id": "d646d3f50d89e342f326", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 65, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "narrative_no_obligation", "reason": "叙述性正文：陈述事实/背景/定义，未含义务或禁止模态，落不了「命中→处理」形态", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-403", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "Given the totality of the evidence, the claim is unsubstantiated.", "unit_id": "35dd0677e48594a8c56d", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 241, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "policy_example_not_rule", "reason": "政策举例（Example N /「The marketer …」情形描述），是示例不是规范条款，单独不成规则（其规范结论在对应正文条款）", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-404", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "Example 31: The marketer of a fruit drink claims that its product is “proven to promote cardiovascular health.” There is one small human clinical study finding a significant difference in arterial pla …[截断]", "unit_id": "4faf3ac13ae798622e97", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 165, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "narrative_no_obligation", "reason": "叙述性正文：陈述事实/背景/定义，未含义务或禁止模态，落不了「命中→处理」形态", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-405", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "However, a subsequent larger study found no significant difference between the fruit drink and placebo on arterial plaque or other measures of cardiovascular health.", "unit_id": "425280e857f4c9618ad4", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 205, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "narrative_no_obligation", "reason": "叙述性正文：陈述事实/背景/定义，未含义务或禁止模态，落不了「命中→处理」形态", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-406", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "A third large trial also found no difference in arterial plaque, although a post hoc analysis of the data found some benefit over placebo in a subgroup of patients with high HDL/low LDL cholesterol le …[截断]", "unit_id": "77dc078e2e2634757e50", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 65, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "narrative_no_obligation", "reason": "叙述性正文：陈述事实/背景/定义，未含义务或禁止模态，落不了「命中→处理」形态", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-407", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "Given the totality of the evidence, the claim is unsubstantiated.", "unit_id": "57ae77c5389f91620b08", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 85, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "narrative_no_obligation", "reason": "叙述性正文：陈述事实/背景/定义，未含义务或禁止模态，落不了「命中→处理」形态", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-408", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "Continuing to tout the earlier small study with favorable results would be deceptive.", "unit_id": "c0f9d8b657d24b23c168", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 223, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "narrative_no_obligation", "reason": "叙述性正文：陈述事实/背景/定义，未含义务或禁止模态，落不了「命中→处理」形态", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-409", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "Moreover, a narrow, qualified claim selectively touting the ostensibly favorable post hoc results of the third study, in light of the contradictory results from both that study and the second study, a …[截断]", "unit_id": "d587d146d4de29cceb2a", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 164, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "policy_example_not_rule", "reason": "政策举例（Example N /「The marketer …」情形描述），是示例不是规范条款，单独不成规则（其规范结论在对应正文条款）", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-410", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "Example 32: An advertiser runs an ad in a magazine for retired people, claiming that its supplement product has been found effective in improving joint flexibility.", "unit_id": "840fc2b4a875b4da598f", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 136, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "narrative_no_obligation", "reason": "叙述性正文：陈述事实/背景/定义，未含义务或禁止模态，落不了「命中→处理」形态", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-411", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "The company sponsored a 12-week study, involving 100 subjects over the age of 65, to test the product’s effect on improving flexibility.", "unit_id": "eeb15a509ca80e8f3b2b", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 117, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "narrative_no_obligation", "reason": "叙述性正文：陈述事实/背景/定义，未含义务或禁止模态，落不了「命中→处理」形态", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-412", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "The study was double-blind and placebo-controlled and has been accepted for publication in a leading medical journal.", "unit_id": "c3def5c947585c0034bd", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 141, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "narrative_no_obligation", "reason": "叙述性正文：陈述事实/背景/定义，未含义务或禁止模态，落不了「命中→处理」形态", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-413", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "The study showed dramatic, statistically significant increases in joint flexibility compared to the placebo, based on objective measurements.", "unit_id": "fc01f622b96f7570845a", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 162, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "narrative_no_obligation", "reason": "叙述性正文：陈述事实/背景/定义，未含义务或禁止模态，落不了「命中→处理」形态", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-414", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "In addition, European researchers have conducted several large independent trials using a similar formulation and dose of the active ingredient in the supplement.", "unit_id": "a60a5edc5acd3768ff85", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 84, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "narrative_no_obligation", "reason": "叙述性正文：陈述事实/背景/定义，未含义务或禁止模态，落不了「命中→处理」形态", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-415", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "These trials also found statistically significant and clinically meaningful results.", "unit_id": "a6b998db0a1f58ba6663", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 169, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "narrative_no_obligation", "reason": "叙述性正文：陈述事实/背景/定义，未含义务或禁止模态，落不了「命中→处理」形态", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-416", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "The advertiser retained an independent expert in joint flexibility who reviewed the underlying European research and confirmed that it meets accepted research standards.", "unit_id": "24f66740d1dcf1a44cc0", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 123, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "narrative_no_obligation", "reason": "叙述性正文：陈述事实/背景/定义，未含义务或禁止模态，落不了「命中→处理」形态", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-417", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "The expert also concluded that the totality of the existing evidence was sufficient to substantiate the advertiser’s claim.", "unit_id": "5eb80e0f12973f8f260b", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 55, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "narrative_no_obligation", "reason": "叙述性正文：陈述事实/背景/定义，未含义务或禁止模态，落不了「命中→处理」形态", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-418", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "The evidence as a whole likely substantiates the claim.", "unit_id": "d683d24c72e78d32b19e", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 2, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "heading_only", "reason": "仅小节标题字母/序号（如「B.」），无判定内容 —— 建议 L2 侧重切，标题应与正文同单元", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-419", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "5.", "unit_id": "6cfc49addcfd4b2e4cf3", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 222, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "narrative_no_obligation", "reason": "叙述性正文：陈述事实/背景/定义，未含义务或禁止模态，落不了「命中→处理」形态", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-420", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "The Relevance of the Evidence to the Specific Product and Claim\n A common problem in the substantiation of advertising claims is that an advertiser has valid studies, but the studies don’t support the …[截断]", "unit_id": "b55106f6e3744680fab0", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 118, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "narrative_no_obligation", "reason": "叙述性正文：陈述事实/背景/定义，未含义务或禁止模态，落不了「命中→处理」形态", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-423", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "[44] Is the ingredient or combination of ingredients in the advertised product the same as what was used in the study?", "unit_id": "53706edffcaf05cb8f3f", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 91, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "narrative_no_obligation", "reason": "叙述性正文：陈述事实/背景/定义，未含义务或禁止模态，落不了「命中→处理」形态", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-424", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "[45] Is the advertised product administered in the same manner as the product in the study?", "unit_id": "e272d96d7fabb0b9eacf", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 88, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "narrative_no_obligation", "reason": "叙述性正文：陈述事实/背景/定义，未含义务或禁止模态，落不了「命中→处理」形态", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-425", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "How well do the outcomes tested in the study relate to the specific benefits advertised?", "unit_id": "11ae83ac73061faa732e", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 96, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "narrative_no_obligation", "reason": "叙述性正文：陈述事实/背景/定义，未含义务或禁止模态，落不了「命中→处理」形态", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-426", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "[46] Does the study population reflect the characteristics of the population targeted by the ad?", "unit_id": "f3598e456d0756dbc9c4", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 79, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "narrative_no_obligation", "reason": "叙述性正文：陈述事实/背景/定义，未含义务或禁止模态，落不了「命中→处理」形态", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-428", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "It’s also important that the claims accurately reflect what the research shows.", "unit_id": "41fee79af561eb99df0c", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 111, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "narrative_no_obligation", "reason": "叙述性正文：陈述事实/背景/定义，未含义务或禁止模态，落不了「命中→处理」形态", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-429", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "Claims that don’t match the research results, no matter how sound that research is, are likely to be deceptive.", "unit_id": "e0b83c60081c9b6a0e54", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 123, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "obligation_without_action", "reason": "有义务模态但既无处理动作也无阈值/词表，无法给出「命中→怎么处理」", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-430", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "Thus, advertisers should be careful not to exaggerate the extent, nature, or permanence of the effects achieved in a study.", "unit_id": "5ac93d42220791c2a0d7", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 117, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "narrative_no_obligation", "reason": "叙述性正文：陈述事实/背景/定义，未含义务或禁止模态，落不了「命中→处理」形态", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-433", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "[49]\n Example 33: An ad for a supplement claims that a particular nutrient helps maintain healthy cholesterol levels.", "unit_id": "a765d5cc3cb919f8d6f9", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 143, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "narrative_no_obligation", "reason": "叙述性正文：陈述事实/背景/定义，未含义务或禁止模态，落不了「命中→处理」形态", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-434", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "There is a substantial body of epidemiologic evidence suggesting that foods high in that nutrient are associated with lower cholesterol levels.", "unit_id": "37808427a8a8d84a229a", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 161, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "narrative_no_obligation", "reason": "叙述性正文：陈述事实/背景/定义，未含义务或禁止模态，落不了「命中→处理」形态", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-435", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "There are no studies, however, demonstrating a relationship between the specific nutrient and cholesterol, although it would be feasible to conduct such a study.", "unit_id": "63bd775483de4fa5e481", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 222, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "narrative_no_obligation", "reason": "叙述性正文：陈述事实/背景/定义，未含义务或禁止模态，落不了「命中→处理」形态", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-436", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "The health effect may be attributable to other food components or to combinations of various components, so a claim about the cholesterol maintenance benefits of the supplement product isn’t substanti …[截断]", "unit_id": "914ddf5ef4b697d4d879", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 196, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "policy_example_not_rule", "reason": "政策举例（Example N /「The marketer …」情形描述），是示例不是规范条款，单独不成规则（其规范结论在对应正文条款）", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-437", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "Example 34: A number of well-controlled clinical studies have been conducted to suggest that a tea improves mental alertness in subjects with significantly impaired blood circulation to the brain.", "unit_id": "637779d33e677c00669d", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 128, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "narrative_no_obligation", "reason": "叙述性正文：陈述事实/背景/定义，未含义务或禁止模态，落不了「命中→处理」形态", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-438", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "A claim suggesting that the tea will improve mental alertness in healthy adults isn’t adequately substantiated by this evidence.", "unit_id": "83c36508fc681036e790", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 200, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "narrative_no_obligation", "reason": "叙述性正文：陈述事实/背景/定义，未含义务或禁止模态，落不了「命中→处理」形态", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-439", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "Advertisers shouldn’t rely on research based on a specific test population for claims targeting the general population without first making sure it is scientifically sound to make such extrapolations.", "unit_id": "66cd19ace5e26f32cc5c", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 100, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "policy_example_not_rule", "reason": "政策举例（Example N /「The marketer …」情形描述），是示例不是规范条款，单独不成规则（其规范结论在对应正文条款）", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-440", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "Example 35: An ad for brain training software shows a man trying to remember where he left his keys.", "unit_id": "f537451f4079d7efca36", "unit_type": "clause"}
