{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 116, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "narrative_no_obligation", "reason": "叙述性正文：陈述事实/背景/定义，未含义务或禁止模态，落不了「命中→处理」形态", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-478", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "Moreover, attempts to disclaim dramatic results with statements like “Results not typical” don’t cure the deception.", "unit_id": "785269bb1904e42b7a3e", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 198, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "narrative_no_obligation", "reason": "叙述性正文：陈述事实/背景/定义，未含义务或禁止模态，落不了「命中→处理」形态", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-480", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "[52]\n Example 41: A magazine ad for a weight-loss supplement features before-and-after photographs of a woman and quotes her as saying that she lost 16 pounds in eight weeks while using the product.", "unit_id": "8bde39ccf577a40875fd", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 135, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "narrative_no_obligation", "reason": "叙述性正文：陈述事实/背景/定义，未含义务或禁止模态，落不了「命中→处理」形态", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-481", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "An asterisk next to the quote references a disclaimer in fine print at the bottom of the ad that reads, “These results are not typical.", "unit_id": "0919e8c4e9c42a1a0dcc", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 241, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "obligation_without_action", "reason": "有义务模态但既无处理动作也无阈值/词表，无法给出「命中→怎么处理」", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-482", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "Your weight loss may not be the same.” The experience of the woman is accurately represented, but a well-conducted RCT demonstrating the efficacy of the supplement shows an average weight loss of only …[截断]", "unit_id": "6302cb1d651845bd9443", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 109, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "narrative_no_obligation", "reason": "叙述性正文：陈述事实/背景/定义，未含义务或禁止模态，落不了「命中→处理」形态", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-483", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "The vague disclosure doesn’t adequately convey to consumers that their weight loss is likely to be much less.", "unit_id": "ca54d5717b5ff5539b08", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 107, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "narrative_no_obligation", "reason": "叙述性正文：陈述事实/背景/定义，未含义务或禁止模态，落不了「命中→处理」形态", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-484", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "The placement and size of the disclaimer is also insufficiently prominent to qualify the claim effectively.", "unit_id": "35a886d23add258615fd", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 95, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "narrative_no_obligation", "reason": "叙述性正文：陈述事实/背景/定义，未含义务或禁止模态，落不了「命中→处理」形态", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-485", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "The statement, “In an 8-week study, subjects taking the supplement lost an average of 5 pounds.", "unit_id": "258abe1ca855a369d05d", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 137, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "narrative_no_obligation", "reason": "叙述性正文：陈述事实/背景/定义，未含义务或禁止模态，落不了「命中→处理」形态", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-486", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "Subjects taking a placebo lost an average of 1 pound,” immediately adjacent to the quote and in prominent font is likely to be effective.", "unit_id": "feec07f73d6a3a8ef1db", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 92, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "narrative_no_obligation", "reason": "叙述性正文：陈述事实/背景/定义，未含义务或禁止模态，落不了「命中→处理」形态", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-489", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "A material connection is one that would affect the weight or credibility of the endorsement.", "unit_id": "4f4286e40fbdea70fbce", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 131, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "narrative_no_obligation", "reason": "叙述性正文：陈述事实/背景/定义，未含义务或禁止模态，落不了「命中→处理」形态", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-490", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "Put another way, any personal, financial, or similar connection that consumers wouldn’t reasonably expect is a material connection.", "unit_id": "c72b9a0c5c7b7ce05791", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 219, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "narrative_no_obligation", "reason": "叙述性正文：陈述事实/背景/定义，未含义务或禁止模态，落不了「命中→处理」形态", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-491", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "[53]\n Example 42: An infomercial for a dietary supplement features an expert referred to as a “Doctor” and a “leading clinician in joint health” discussing the effect of the product on the maintenance …[截断]", "unit_id": "3dbe4c885c21a412a8fa", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 149, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "narrative_no_obligation", "reason": "叙述性正文：陈述事实/背景/定义，未含义务或禁止模态，落不了「命中→处理」形态", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-492", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "The expert isn’t licensed to practice medicine, but has a doctoral degree in psychology and is a trained physical therapist who runs a sports clinic.", "unit_id": "da42e2d81437ceb15867", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 110, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "narrative_no_obligation", "reason": "叙述性正文：陈述事实/背景/定义，未含义务或禁止模态，落不了「命中→处理」形态", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-493", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "The expert hasn’t conducted any review of the scientific literature on the active component of the supplement.", "unit_id": "eb3f22584c618ecb36b5", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 102, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "narrative_no_obligation", "reason": "叙述性正文：陈述事实/背景/定义，未含义务或禁止模态，落不了「命中→处理」形态", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-494", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "In return for appearing in the infomercial, she is given a paid position as an officer of the company.", "unit_id": "34915fcf57da6d0b2374", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 53, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "narrative_no_obligation", "reason": "叙述性正文：陈述事实/背景/定义，未含义务或禁止模态，落不了「命中→处理」形态", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-495", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "The ad is likely to be deceptive for several reasons.", "unit_id": "4c522a9171b6c21a97ad", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 153, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "narrative_no_obligation", "reason": "叙述性正文：陈述事实/背景/定义，未含义务或禁止模态，落不了「命中→处理」形态", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-496", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "First, her qualifications as an expert have been overstated and she hasn’t conducted an examination of the product sufficient to support the endorsement.", "unit_id": "2ee32bd2fa2e587cb421", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 149, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "narrative_no_obligation", "reason": "叙述性正文：陈述事实/背景/定义，未含义务或禁止模态，落不了「命中→处理」形态", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-497", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "In addition, her connection to the company is one that consumers might not expect and that might affect the weight or credibility of her endorsement.", "unit_id": "2cce563af300b59f868c", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 196, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "policy_example_not_rule", "reason": "政策举例（Example N /「The marketer …」情形描述），是示例不是规范条款，单独不成规则（其规范结论在对应正文条款）", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-499", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "Example 43: A best-selling book about the benefits of a popular dietary supplement ingredient recommends a specific brand of the product as the highest quality, most effective brand on the market.", "unit_id": "5236c1e70db705f3b449", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 153, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "narrative_no_obligation", "reason": "叙述性正文：陈述事实/背景/定义，未含义务或禁止模态，落不了「命中→处理」形态", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-500", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "The manufacturer of the brand cited in the book has an exclusive promotional agreement with the author and has paid her to reference the product by name.", "unit_id": "70c0844296f4a6c8b0a1", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 109, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "narrative_no_obligation", "reason": "叙述性正文：陈述事实/背景/定义，未含义务或禁止模态，落不了「命中→处理」形态", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-501", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "The manufacturer’s ad touts the fact that its product is the only brand recommended in the best-selling book.", "unit_id": "c8f0f81169535e750633", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 164, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "narrative_no_obligation", "reason": "叙述性正文：陈述事实/背景/定义，未含义务或禁止模态，落不了「命中→处理」形态", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-502", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "The ad is deceptive because it suggests to consumers that the endorsement is unbiased when, in fact, the author was paid by the manufacturer to promote the product.", "unit_id": "3f17ac1a16b502ec6ff0", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 219, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "narrative_no_obligation", "reason": "叙述性正文：陈述事实/背景/定义，未含义务或禁止模态，落不了「命中→处理」形态", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-503", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "The book’s paid promotional reference to a specific brand is also advertising for the product and is deceptive without a clear and conspicuous disclosure of the connection between the manufacturer and …[截断]", "unit_id": "d13febb24871e8dd318a", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 2, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "heading_only", "reason": "仅小节标题字母/序号（如「B.」），无判定内容 —— 建议 L2 侧重切，标题应与正文同单元", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-504", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "2.", "unit_id": "03e3ed3f50b1888c636e", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 297, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "narrative_no_obligation", "reason": "叙述性正文：陈述事实/背景/定义，未含义务或禁止模态，落不了「命中→处理」形态", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-505", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "Claims Based on Traditional Use\n A number of health-related products, including botanical supplements, homeopathic medicines, [54] and other alternative products, have a long history of use as traditi …[截断]", "unit_id": "1e1299d49f92bd861aff", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 193, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "citation_fragment_not_rule", "reason": "法学期刊引注残片（判例/条文引用），无「须/不得」义务，不构成可判定规则", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-506", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "Under FTC law, claims for products based on traditional use are subject to the same requirement of substantiation in the form of competent and reliable scientific evidence as any other product.", "unit_id": "2cca835995c6aff86a75", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 215, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "narrative_no_obligation", "reason": "叙述性正文：陈述事实/背景/定义，未含义务或禁止模态，落不了「命中→处理」形态", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-508", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "Advertising that merely describes the traditional or historic use of a product and that is carefully qualified to avoid any misleading implications about the product’s efficacy or health benefits may  …[截断]", "unit_id": "b499537e405733c4fd02", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 150, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "narrative_no_obligation", "reason": "叙述性正文：陈述事实/背景/定义，未含义务或禁止模态，落不了「命中→处理」形态", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-510", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "If there is a significant difference between the traditional use of the product and the marketed product, a “traditional use” claim isn’t appropriate.", "unit_id": "f15aab69aff93d73a780", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 72, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "narrative_no_obligation", "reason": "叙述性正文：陈述事实/背景/定义，未含义务或禁止模态，落不了「命中→处理」形态", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-513", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "To be effective, it may actually need to be incorporated into the claim.", "unit_id": "b82cb374a5000c8e30f0", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 220, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "narrative_no_obligation", "reason": "叙述性正文：陈述事实/背景/定义，未含义务或禁止模态，落不了「命中→处理」形态", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-514", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "As with all claims, marketers shouldn’t undercut a disclosure about the lack of science with additional positive statements, consumer endorsements, images, or other elements of the ad suggesting the p …[截断]", "unit_id": "ad8c86e50a7e0cfd4b52", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 193, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "citation_fragment_not_rule", "reason": "法学期刊引注残片（判例/条文引用），无「须/不得」义务，不构成可判定规则", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-516", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "The FTC will look closely at how consumers perceive a traditional use claim and whether they assume the claim means the product is effective and backed by more evidence than the marketers have.", "unit_id": "940e17795adc91b78288", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-506", "char_count": 96, "kb_type": "external_standard", "kind": "narrative_no_obligation", "reason": "叙述性正文：陈述事实/背景/定义，未含义务或禁止模态，落不了「命中→处理」形态", "resource_id": "url__https____www.ftc.gov_business-guidance_resources_health-products-compliance-guidance", "seg_anchor": "#l.1-506/seg-517", "source_sha256": "b079385463060a8b87c423f6961c3a9879296054b618fe7c41856a0d778ef8ba", "text": "An ad that, despite a disclosure, conveys more substantiation than a marketer has, is deceptive.", "unit_id": "7253a6d6f0c29535538b", "unit_type": "clause"}
